  "id": "a8a8a1f8-20e3-4fe2-8b30-9f7cfbdb00c9",
  "title": "Unified Diffusion Techniques for Unlearnable Examples",
  "summary": "This paper introduces DUNE (Diffusion Unified Network Refiner) for refining diffusion models, while DiffUE (Diffusion UE) enhances unlearnable examples by modifying semantic features instead of pixel space, offering improved trade-offs between utility and unlearnability.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "DUNE refines diffusion models to suppress artifacts, improving fidelity and reducing hallucinations across multiple backbones.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "DiffUE introduces a diffusion-based autoencoder to manipulate semantic features, enhancing unlearnability while preserving image quality and utility.",
